HUWE SHAHEED GHAREEB UL WATAN IMAM E RAZA. <br>
TADAP KE ROOTI HAI PHIR ROOH E FATIMA ZAHRA.<br>
<br>
1. TAMAM CHAHANE WALAY YE ROOKE KEHTAY HAIN. <br>
 TAQI KE SAR SE UTHA HAYE BAAP KA SAAYA.<br>
<br>
2. JAHAN MAY GHAM KI GHATA CHAAGAYI HAI CHARO TARAF. <br>
 CHARAGH AATHWA GUL HOGAYA IMAMAT KA.<br>
<br>
3. PILAYA ZEHER JO MAMOON NE HUWA YE ASAR. <br>
 JIGAR KE TUKDE HUWAY OR TADAP GAYE MOULA.<br>
<br>
4. BAPA THA SHAHRE QURASAAN MAY JAA BAJA MATAM. <br>
 WATAN SE AAYI THI BHAI SE MILNE MASOOMA.<br>
<br>
5. NAHI HAI AAP KA BHAI LAHAD HAI BHAI KI. <br>
 QABARVYE SUNTE HII GHASH KHAA KE GIRGAYI DUKHIYA.<br>
<br>
6. QUDA NASEEB KARE JALD WO BHI DINN HUMKO. <br>
 KAMAL JAAKE YEH MASHHAD MAY HUM PADHE NOUHA.<br>
<br>
AZZ: MOHSIN KAMAAL.